156
00:07:47,540 --> 00:07:49,530
Rock-Paper-Scissors-Lizard-Spock

157
00:07:49,530 --> 00:07:52,060
was created by Internet pioneer Sam Kass

158
00:07:52,060 --> 00:07:54,890
as an improvement on the classic game Rock-Paper-Scissors.

159
00:07:54,890 --> 00:07:56,540
All hail Sam Kass.

160
00:07:56,540 --> 00:07:57,780
Hail.

161
00:07:59,560 --> 00:08:00,430
How does it work?

162
00:08:00,430 --> 00:08:01,910
Oh, it's very simple.

163
00:08:01,910 --> 00:08:04,630
Scissors cuts paper, paper covers rock,

164
00:08:04,630 --> 00:08:07,530
