170
00:08:26,610 --> 00:08:27,320
Well, of course.

171
00:08:27,320 --> 00:08:29,800
Scissors cuts paper, paper covers rock,

172
00:08:29,800 --> 00:08:32,030
rock crushes lizard, lizard poisons Spock,

173
00:08:32,030 --> 00:08:33,190
Spock smashes scissors,

174
00:08:33,190 --> 00:08:34,820
scissors decapitates lizard,

175
00:08:34,830 --> 00:08:36,320
lizard eats paper,

176
00:08:36,320 --> 00:08:38,400
paper disproves Spock, Spock vaporizes rock,

177
00:08:38,400 --> 00:08:40,910
and as it always has, rock crushes scissors.

178
00:08:44,370 --> 00:08:45,610
Almost got it. One more time.

179
00:08:45,610 --> 00:08:47,860
Surely. Scissors cuts paper, paper covers rock, rock...

180
00:08:47,860 --> 00:08:49,390
Sheldon, stop.

181
00:08:49,390 --> 00:08:51,270
