209
00:09:54,280 --> 00:09:55,650
All right, this is one-on-one.

210
00:09:55,650 --> 00:09:58,480
First person to five wins the office. Any questions?

211
00:09:58,550 --> 00:09:59,470
Yes, Sheldon.

212
00:09:59,470 --> 00:10:00,760
